      "statement": "The execution, task, sre-shared, lambda-invoker, create-investigation-lambda, reap-tasks-lambda, bedrock-invocation-logging, and optional s3-replication roles are looked up by name via data.aws_iam_role in deploy/regional/account-iam.tf rather than owned as aws_iam_role resources in the regional root; deploy/regional/iam.tf attaches only inline aws_iam_role_policy grants to these data-sourced role IDs, and deploy/regional/account-handoff.tf records removed blocks (destroy = false) for the identities this state used to own.",
